### Findings (0.14.2, local run, fresh coverage)
- `complexity`: 4 methods over the cyclomatic limit (gate FAIL).
- `class_size`: 35 violations (WARN).
- `analyze` Max CRAP 23.42 (FAIL, threshold 8.00). Top: `_guessContentType` (github_release_assets.dart:122), `_isBlockLevel` (markdown_to_jira_markup.dart:227), `_runChunkSync` (agents_suite.dart:623).
